    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present 4D Avalon, Burrow Road, a charming one-bedroom top floor apartment ideally positioned within this peaceful, low-density coastal development with direct beach access. Presented in good condition throughout, making it an ideal opportunity for downsizer looking for a safe, well located and easy to maintain home as well as first time buyers and owner occupiers. Would also be an ideal investment opportunity.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall with additional storage, spacious living/dining room with balcony enjoying sea views, separate fitted kitchen, double bedroom with access to a second south-facing balcony, and a full bathroom.\n\nThe location is truly exceptional. Situated along the highly sought-after Burrow Road, residents can enjoy immediate access to the beach and scenic coastal surroundings. Howth village is just minutes away and offers an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops, and renowned coastal walks, while Sutton Cross and its many amenities are also close by. The area is well serviced by both DART and bus routes providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre, with Dublin Airport also within easy reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.45m x 4.34m\nEntrance hall with terracotta coloured tiled flooring, hot press, and additional storage space.\n\nLiving Room - 3.61m x 5.49m\nSpacious living room featuring a fireplace with electric fire, TV point and finished with recessed lighting, and terracotta coloured tiled flooring throughout. A glass door opens onto a private balcony enjoying beautiful sea views.\n\nKitchen - 2.05m x 2.32m\nFitted kitchen with wooden cabinetry, laminate countertop, tiled flooring, and tiled splashback. Integrated appliances include an oven and electric hob, with plumbing for a washing machine and space for a fridge. A skylight provides natural light.\n\nBedroom - 3.61m x 2.79m\nDouble bedroom with terracotta tiled flooring and sliding wardrobes. A glass door provides access to a private balcony.\n\nBathroom - 2.05m x 1.91m\nBathroom featuring terracotta tiled flooring and partially tiled walls, complete with WC, wash hand basin, bath tub, and skylight.\n\nBalcony - \nTwo balconies in total, including a balcony off the living room enjoying sea views, and a second tiled balcony off the bedroom overlooking the car park.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Top (First Floor)</li><li>Direct Beach Access</li><li>Sea View</li><li>Good condition</li><li>Electric Heating</li><li>Double Glazed Windows</li><li>Intercom</li><li>2 X Balconies</li><li>Landscaped Gardens</li><li>Electric Gates/Resident Parking</li><li>Management Fee 1,800 p.a. approx.</ul>"
      },
